Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(machines): Makera Carvera and Carvera Air machine
 files

From Makera's own spec tables (makera.com, read 2026-11-10): work area as
the full stroke either way, 200 W spindle to 15000 / 13000 rpm, one travel
speed for every axis (6000 / 4000 mm/min), the Carvera's six-tool changer,
and the firmware's M7 air blast as the only coolant. Registered in
posting::MACHINES; pinned by carvera_machines.

Refs #707

